For each word below, write ONE short sentence (12 to 22 words) that uses the word itself, spelled in full, in the sense given. Give it voice and mood: a question, someone speaking, a sigh, delight, a warning. No definitions; show the word in a moment of life. Answer as one JSON object mapping each WORD (as given, upper case) to its sentence. JSON only.

MUTED: in a softened tone.
NEGOTIATE: discuss the terms of an arrangement.
NEUTRAL: one who does not side with any party in a war or dispute.
NEUTRON: an elementary particle with 0 charge and mass about equal to a proton.
NOBLE: a titled peer of the realm.
NODE: a connecting point at which several lines come together.
